00:07:03.919 --> 00:07:04.949
And he's like, "I'm coming!

00:07:04.949 --> 00:07:06.480
I'm coming to help you!"

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.810
And he was really sad about this crying dinosaur.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:09.810
And I literally...

00:07:09.810 --> 00:07:13.680
At that point, I was just like, "I don't care
about this at all.

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.680
I don't...

00:07:14.680 --> 00:07:21.110
